From 8b51265374e92a3517e08c4e29657e209b807ca2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.net>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:08:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dhcpd: run DHCP only on the interfaces /etc/net/config.toml
 asks for

One [interface.<name>] section per interface: ipv4 = "dhcp" starts DHCP
there, "off" or no section starts nothing; boards limits a section to
some boards (init BOARD names). No file, or no interface with DHCP: dhcpd
exits at once, silently. Keys for a fixed address and IPv6 are accepted
for later; unknown keys give one error line (redox-rpi #622).
---
